    <task id="LOCAL-00001" summary="feat(refactor): complete save/load system overhaul and content setup&#10;&#10;This commit finalizes the save/load system stability, dialogue state restoration, &#10;and prepares the project for main narrative content.&#10;&#10;CORE FIXES &amp; REFACTORING:&#10;- Implement seamless new game start flow: when all save slots are full, the player &#10;  is now prompted to reset one, and upon confirmation, is automatically taken to &#10;  the Character Selection scene. This was achieved by moving the scene loading &#10;  coroutine to the persistent GameManager, eliminating previous race conditions &#10;  and blank screen issues.&#10;- Fix exact line loading: DialogueManager now restores the precise dialogue line on load.&#10;- Fix dialogue inactivity after load by ensuring DialogueManager is initialized before restoration.&#10;- Fix overwrite logic causing Main Menu buttons to become unresponsive after overwrite/reset.&#10;- Fix auto-save on reset: Refactored flag cleanup to occur after new scene load and save, &#10;  ensuring new games are saved automatically.&#10;- Add UI/UX validation in PauseMenu.cs to prevent saving during CharacterSelectionScene.&#10;- Update Playtime to count total playtime instead of slot-specific playtime.&#10;- Remove redundant SaveLoadPanel.cs after merging its functionality into SaveLoadManager.cs.&#10;&#10;CONTENT PROGRESS:&#10;- Finalized Character Selection Scene logic.&#10;- Added placeholder scenes for upcoming prologue sequences.">
